#: withdrawal/src/Settings.php:16
msgctxt "owb"
msgid "General"
msgstr "Ġenerali"

#: withdrawal/src/Settings.php:21
msgctxt "owb"
msgid ""
"Configure the EU-compliant order withdrawal button (Directive (EU) "
"2023/2673). Customers use the withdrawal form page to withdraw from a "
"contract; requests appear under the Requests tab."
msgstr ""
"Ikkonfigura l-buttuna tal-irtirar tal-ordnijiet konformi mal-UE (Direttiva "
"(UE) 2023/2673). Il-klijenti jużaw il-paġna tal-formola tal-irtirar biex "
"jirtiraw minn kuntratt; it-talbiet jidhru taħt it-tab Talbiet."

#: withdrawal/src/Settings.php:41
msgctxt "owb"
msgid "Withdrawal page"
msgstr "Paġna tal-irtirar"

#: withdrawal/src/Settings.php:45
msgctxt "owb"
msgid "This page should contain your withdrawal form shortcode."
msgstr ""
"Din il-paġna għandu jkun fiha x-shortcode tal-formola tal-irtirar tiegħek."

#: withdrawal/src/Settings.php:56
msgctxt "owb"
msgid "Embed in footer"
msgstr "Daħħal fil-footer"

#: withdrawal/src/Settings.php:57
msgctxt "owb"
msgid ""
"Embed the withdrawal button directly in the footer. Disable this option if "
"you plan to embed the page manually."
msgstr ""
"Daħħal il-buttuna tal-irtirar direttament fil-footer. Iddiżattiva din l-"
"għażla jekk għandek il-ħsieb tinkorpora l-paġna manwalment."

#: withdrawal/src/Settings.php:65
msgctxt "owb"
msgid "Display everywhere"
msgstr "Uri kullimkien"

#: withdrawal/src/Settings.php:66
msgctxt "owb"
msgid "Display the button on every page, not just on shop-related pages."
msgstr ""
"Uri l-buttuna fuq kull paġna, mhux biss fuq il-paġni relatati mal-ħanut."

#: withdrawal/src/Settings.php:77
msgctxt "owb"
msgid "Button text"
msgstr "Test tal-buttuna"

#: withdrawal/src/Settings.php:78
msgctxt "owb"
msgid ""
"Text of the withdrawal button in the footer and header menu, and of the "
"[eggl_wd_order_withdrawal_button] shortcode. Leave empty to use \"Withdraw "
"from contract\" in each visitor's language. The Directive asks for wording "
"such as \"withdraw from contract here\" or an equally unambiguous phrase."
msgstr ""
"It-test tal-buttuna tal-irtirar fil-footer u fil-menu tal-header, u tax-"
"shortcode [eggl_wd_order_withdrawal_button]. Ħalliha vojta biex tuża "
"\"Irtira mill-kuntratt\" fil-lingwa ta' kull viżitatur. Id-Direttiva titlob "
"kliem bħal \"irtira mill-kuntratt hawn\" jew frażi oħra daqstant ċara."

#: withdrawal/src/Settings.php:87
msgctxt "owb"
msgid "Header menu"
msgstr "Menu tal-intestatura"

#: withdrawal/src/Settings.php:88
msgctxt "owb"
msgid ""
"Added to the main header menu (desktop and mobile). While off, the "
"withdrawal page is also kept out of the automatic page list some themes show "
"when no menu has been set up."
msgstr ""
"Miżjud mal-menu ewlieni tal-intestatura (desktop u mobile). Meta jkun mitfi, "
"il-paġna tal-irtirar tinżamm ukoll barra mil-lista awtomatika tal-paġni li "
"xi temi juru meta ma jkun ġie stabbilit l-ebda menu."

#: withdrawal/src/Settings.php:88
msgctxt "owb"
msgid "Show a \"Withdraw from contract\" link in the site's header menu."
msgstr "Uri link \"Irtira mill-kuntratt\" fil-menu tal-intestatura tas-sit."

#: withdrawal/src/Settings.php:96
msgctxt "owb"
msgid "Guest validation"
msgstr "Validazzjoni tal-mistednin"

#: withdrawal/src/Settings.php:97
msgctxt "owb"
msgid ""
"Choose how to validate guest withdrawal requests. Spam protection via a "
"built-in honeypot field and IP limits apply."
msgstr ""
"Agħżel kif jiġu vvalidati t-talbiet għall-irtirar tal-mistednin. Tapplika "
"protezzjoni kontra l-ispam permezz ta' qasam honeypot integrat u limiti tal-"
"IP."

#: withdrawal/src/Settings.php:97
msgctxt "owb"
msgid ""
"Please note: As to current legal interpretation a validation lock would mean "
"that a consumer who makes a typo might no longer be able to submit their "
"withdrawal within the prescribed time limit—which directly contradicts the "
"protective purpose of Section 356a of the German Civil Code (BGB). Please "
"seek legal advise before using."
msgstr ""
"Jekk jogħġbok innota: Skont l-interpretazzjoni legali attwali, lock ta' "
"validazzjoni jfisser li konsumatur li jagħmel żball tat-tajpjar jista' ma "
"jibqax jista' jissottometti l-irtirar tiegħu fil-limitu ta' żmien preskritt "
"— li jmur direttament kontra l-iskop protettiv tat-Taqsima 356a tal-Kodiċi "
"Ċivili Ġermaniż (BGB). Jekk jogħġbok fittex parir legali qabel tużah."

#: withdrawal/src/Settings.php:103
msgctxt "owb"
msgid "Enforce that the order number entered exists."
msgstr "Obbliga li n-numru tal-ordni mdaħħal jeżisti."

#: withdrawal/src/Settings.php:104
msgctxt "owb"
msgid "Order must exist and email must match the one from the original order."
msgstr ""
"L-ordni trid teżisti u l-email trid taqbel ma' dik tal-ordni oriġinali."

#: withdrawal/src/Settings.php:105
msgctxt "owb"
msgid "Either order number or email address must exist."
msgstr "Jew in-numru tal-ordni jew l-indirizz tal-email irid jeżisti."

#: withdrawal/src/Settings.php:106
msgctxt "owb"
msgid "Do not validate"
msgstr "Tivvalidax"

#: withdrawal/src/Settings.php:111
msgctxt "owb"
msgid "Partial withdrawals"
msgstr "Irtirar parzjali"

#: withdrawal/src/Settings.php:112
msgctxt "owb"
msgid ""
"Allow customers and verified guests to select which order items to withdraw."
msgstr ""
"Ippermetti lill-klijenti u lill-mistednin ivverifikati jagħżlu liema oġġetti "
"tal-ordni jirtiraw."

#: withdrawal/src/Settings.php:120
msgctxt "owb"
msgid "Mandatory fields"
msgstr "Oqsma obbligatorji"

#: withdrawal/src/Settings.php:122
msgctxt "owb"
msgid ""
"Select fields that should be mandatory while submitting a new withdrawal"
msgstr ""
"Agħżel l-oqsma li għandhom ikunu obbligatorji meta tiġi sottomessa talba "
"ġdida għall-irtirar"

#: withdrawal/src/Settings.php:142
msgctxt "owb"
msgid "Allow guests to enter additional information in a separate text field."
msgstr ""
"Ippermetti lill-mistednin idaħħlu informazzjoni addizzjonali f'qasam tat-"
"test separat."

#: withdrawal/src/Settings.php:150
msgctxt "owb"
msgid "Non-refundable"
msgstr "Mhux rimborżabbli"

#: withdrawal/src/Settings.php:151
msgctxt "owb"
msgid "Choose certain product types to exclude from being withdrawn."
msgstr "Agħżel ċerti tipi ta' prodotti biex jiġu esklużi mill-irtirar."

#: withdrawal/src/Settings.php:162
msgctxt "owb"
msgid "Withdrawal period"
msgstr "Perjodu tal-irtirar"

#: withdrawal/src/Settings.php:163
msgctxt "owb"
msgid ""
"Choose the number of days, starting with the orders' completed date, to "
"accept withdrawals for orders."
msgstr ""
"Agħżel in-numru ta' jiem, li jibdew mid-data meta l-ordni tiġi kkompletata, "
"li matulhom jiġi aċċettat l-irtirar tal-ordnijiet."

#: withdrawal/src/Settings.php:164
msgctxt "owb"
msgid "Days"
msgstr "Jiem"

#: withdrawal/src/Settings.php:164
msgctxt "owb"
msgid ""
"Keep in mind that the withdrawal period does not begin until the customer "
"receives the order. If necessary add a buffer period depending on your "
"shipping process. Use 0 to make withdrawals available at any time."
msgstr ""
"Żomm f'moħħok li l-perjodu tal-irtirar ma jibdiex qabel ma l-klijent "
"jirċievi l-ordni. Jekk meħtieġ żid perjodu ta' buffer skont il-proċess tat-"
"tbaħħir tiegħek. Uża 0 biex l-irtirar ikun disponibbli fi kwalunkwe ħin."

#: withdrawal/src/Settings.php:174
msgctxt "owb"
msgid "Unverified requests"
msgstr "Talbiet mhux ivverifikati"

#: withdrawal/src/Settings.php:175
msgctxt "owb"
msgid "Do not adjust order status for unverified requests."
msgstr "Tbiddilx l-istatus tal-ordni għal talbiet mhux ivverifikati."

#: withdrawal/src/Settings.php:175
msgctxt "owb"
msgid ""
"For some requests, the email address differs from the original stored within "
"the order. Make sure these requests do not automatically set the pending "
"withdrawal order status."
msgstr ""
"Għal xi talbiet, l-indirizz tal-email huwa differenti minn dak oriġinali "
"maħżun fl-ordni. Kun żgur li dawn it-talbiet ma jissettjawx awtomatikament l-"
"istatus tal-ordni ta' irtirar pendenti."

#: withdrawal/src/Settings.php:183
msgctxt "owb"
msgid "Contact email"
msgstr "Email ta' kuntatt"

#: withdrawal/src/Settings.php:184
msgctxt "owb"
msgid ""
"Please provide an email address where customers can contact you if they have "
"any issues."
msgstr ""
"Jekk jogħġbok agħti indirizz tal-email fejn il-klijenti jistgħu "
"jikkuntattjawk jekk ikollhom xi problemi."

#: withdrawal/src/Settings.php:194
msgctxt "owb"
msgid "My account page"
msgstr "Paġna tal-kont tiegħi"

#: withdrawal/src/Settings.php:195
msgctxt "owb"
msgid ""
"On the my account page, add a link to create a new withdrawal request for "
"the order in case available."
msgstr ""
"Fil-paġna tal-kont tiegħi, żid link biex tinħoloq talba ġdida għall-irtirar "
"għall-ordni jekk disponibbli."

#: withdrawal/src/Settings.php:195
msgctxt "owb"
msgid ""
"Shown as a \"Withdraw\" button next to \"View\" in My account → Orders, and "
"under \"Actions\" when the customer opens an order. It only appears for "
"orders that can still be withdrawn: processing or completed, within the "
"withdrawal period, with items left to withdraw, and once the withdrawal page "
"is published."
msgstr ""
"Tidher bħala buttuna \"Irtira\" ħdejn \"Ara\" f'My account → Orders, u taħt "
"\"Azzjonijiet\" meta l-klijent jiftaħ ordni. Tidher biss għal ordnijiet li "
"għadhom jistgħu jiġu rtirati: qed jiġu pproċessati jew ikkompletati, fil-"
"perjodu tal-irtirar, b'oġġetti li għad iridu jiġu rtirati, u ladarba l-paġna "
"tal-irtirar tkun ippubblikata."

